                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bd69f3f7-bb8a-38c0-9c7b-660769111939",
                        "entry_id": "60cde2b5-3b28-3300-b72a-c631299ba408",
                        "glosses": [
                            "傻子，呆子"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8d4e1b55-2afb-41b9-b863-4f8a350f0826",
                                "sense_id": "bd69f3f7-bb8a-38c0-9c7b-660769111939",
                                "text": "\"Ill-fard, crazy, crack-brained gowk, that she is!\" exclaimed the housekeeper.",
                                "translation": "「她真是個相貌醜陋、瘋瘋癲癲、腦袋壞掉的呆子！」管家大聲叫道。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "93d01349-0416-483a-bfaa-aae49bdf761e",
                                "sense_id": "bd69f3f7-bb8a-38c0-9c7b-660769111939",
                                "text": "\"What does it look like?\" \"Like...like...\" Catweazle made boulder-like gestures in the air, \"like a wogle-stone, thou gowk.\"",
                                "translation": "「它長什麼樣子？」「像……像……」卡特威澤在空中比劃著大圓石的手勢，「像塊圓石，你這呆子。」"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "97a59a1b-1539-40d7-8157-36804c8d8e9b",
                                "sense_id": "bd69f3f7-bb8a-38c0-9c7b-660769111939",
                                "text": "God has sent me gowks for secretaries.",
                                "translation": "上帝派了些傻瓜來給我當秘書。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "173e59a9-7d99-42fd-ad27-59ef45779e75",
                                "sense_id": "bd69f3f7-bb8a-38c0-9c7b-660769111939",
                                "text": "`You daft great gowk, puttin' yerself in the way of harm after all this time out of a war.'",
                                "translation": "「你這大笨蛋，都從戰場回來這麼久了，還把自己往火坑裡推。」"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
